m1	326,198,1576,702		The first three positions of the C major triad on treble and bass staves, three bars: each chord in minims with its combinational tones as crotchets, quavers and semiquavers, some marked by a downward sloping line as slightly flat.
m2	333,794,1582,1304		The minor triads with their combinational tones, three bars on treble and bass staves in three flats: each chord in minims with its combinational tones as crotchets, quavers and semiquavers, some marked by a sloping line as slightly deeper.
